  "title": "\"Send\" button grayed out while editing a post",
  "content": "<p>I was trying to edit my post here:</p><p><a href=\"https://community.st.com/feedback-forum-118/inconsistent-presentation-of-links-167657?postid=747370#post747370\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_self\">https://community.st.com/feedback-forum-118/inconsistent-presentation-of-links-167657?postid=747370#post747370</a></p><p> </p><p>After inserting images and links and stuff, the “Send” button was grayed out. I had to hit “Cancel”, edit the post again, redo everything, and hit send (which was not grayed out this time). No indication as to why it was grayed out.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/9f317c72-b904-42a8-932e-306e1487b48a.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
